{"chapter": "moduli", "node_kind": "paragraph", "parent_tag": "0DM5", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$f : X \\to B$", "MATH_0002": "$\\Hilbfunctor_{X/B}$", "MATH_0003": "$B$", "REF_0001": "\\ref{quot-proposition-hilb}", "STRUCT_0001": "\\noindent"}, "render": {"prefix": "", "suffix": ""}, "risk_level": "R2", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:450a41b9dee08c48e488b3d1689eff553fd8695fabe839d07c86b8f16d8f3bf9", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:d0e332a7e8347da0c0064312a74ad28e3b72692da2188975e8fb1d7927176d47", "source_text": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\nLet <MATH_0001> be a morphism of algebraic spaces which is\nseparated and of finite presentation. Then\n<MATH_0002> is an algebraic space locally of finite\npresentation over <MATH_0003>. See Quot, Proposition <REF_0001>.\n\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:b9d5907c6fa95fae4666e109c9a2d264625cac8881ebde7c99ae92d888dc237c", "unit_id": "tag:0DM5:prose-0001"}
