{"chapter": "moduli", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "0DM5", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$\\Hilbfunctor_{X/B} \\to B$"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-hilb-s-lfp}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:72118ae8d14c99cadc30ee9cdbe9e57792608b1625d04eb871154d1a53b9ec40", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:4ad4d52fc3b2236d5587e34ae8ec7760646eb48643df2b66b8a8da55c4d1c4b3", "source_text": "The morphism <MATH_0001> is separated\nand locally of finite presentation.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:8d63642ca3da00213568eea75fe4787c5007556a0627e4f4c401159abd1658a6", "unit_id": "tag:0DM7:statement"}
{"chapter": "moduli", "node_kind": "proof", "parent_tag": "0DM5", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$\\Hilbfunctor_{X/B} \\to B$", "REF_0001": "\\ref{lemma-hilb-diagonal-closed}", "REF_0002": "\\ref{quot-proposition-hilb}"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{proof}\n", "suffix": "\\end{proof}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:72118ae8d14c99cadc30ee9cdbe9e57792608b1625d04eb871154d1a53b9ec40", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:acf39c791b7378a1084db8d599a83bb38474d5fd3389d2cd4e3bc3030808ec33", "source_text": "To check <MATH_0001> is separated we have to\nshow that its diagonal is a closed immersion. This\nis true by Lemma <REF_0001>.\nThe second statement is part of\nQuot, Proposition <REF_0002>.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:f3e0b976f1d58ea30fff8c252425d2be46c76681454ad6daf38b1d6d36614b6b", "unit_id": "tag:0DM7:proof"}
{"chapter": "moduli", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "0DM5", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$X \\to B$", "MATH_0002": "$\\Hilbfunctor_{X/B} \\to B$", "REF_0001": "\\ref{spaces-morphisms-definition-valuative-criterion}"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-hilb-existence-part}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:7e7ffab48e5c35aa0953e852407d995dd01fd3655c6899c2592593e1df0ef61a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:5b55fae54ce5b1c1fb846ab0886b717f85944d9c847e2c411cb69e11b5d4f8d7", "source_text": "Assume <MATH_0001> is proper as well as of finite presentation.\nThen <MATH_0002> satisfies the existence part\nof the valuative criterion (Morphisms of Spaces, Definition\n<REF_0001>).\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:e2be1f305a40fdadfa8b302c0727c4ef233ba9470777184a738ebbd324dbae14", "unit_id": "tag:0DM8:statement"}
